      "start_seconds": 1.27,
      "end_seconds": 4.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "Yeah, hi doctor, am I too early?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.39,
      "end_seconds": 9.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Come in. Please sit. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.85,
      "end_seconds": 23.5,
      "duration_seconds": 12.65,
      "text": "So, I've been losing weight without trying, doctor. My neighbour said I should get it looked at. I've been reading about it online and it worried me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.18,
      "end_seconds": 26.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "any regular medication at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.2,
      "end_seconds": 28.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "nothing regular, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.23,
      "end_seconds": 35.35,
      "duration_seconds": 5.12,
      "text": "Did it come on recently? I'll explain everything as we go along."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.08,
      "end_seconds": 40.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "I've had it for about a year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 52.18,
      "end_seconds": 54.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "How about coughing up blood?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.23,
      "end_seconds": 59.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "I haven't noticed any coughing up blood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.64,
      "end_seconds": 65.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.9,
      "text": "have you noticed bone pain, vomiting or blood in the stool?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.53,
      "end_seconds": 74.15,
      "duration_seconds": 6.62,
      "text": "No bone pain, vomiting or blood in the stool, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.17,
      "end_seconds": 80.56,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "Have you noticed any weakness, or anything odd with your balance?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.46,
      "end_seconds": 83.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "no, nothing like that"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.42,
      "end_seconds": 88.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.41,
      "end_seconds": 93.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "No, nothing at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.1,
      "end_seconds": 111.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "Right, what do you do during the day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.36,
      "end_seconds": 116.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "I look after my grandchildren most days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.15,
      "end_seconds": 120.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "tell me about your eating"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.78,
      "end_seconds": 127.59,
      "duration_seconds": 5.81,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.8,
      "end_seconds": 142.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.05,
      "end_seconds": 151.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "let me think, no, I've never reacted to anything"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.9,
      "end_seconds": 171.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "let's start with the basic checks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.41,
      "end_seconds": 183.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "Sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.62,
      "end_seconds": 203.6,
      "duration_seconds": 6.98,
      "text": "Okay: respiratory rate 16, blood pressure 114 over 72, temp 36.5 degrees, heart rate 70."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.19,
      "end_seconds": 209.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.07,
      "end_seconds": 223.32,
      "duration_seconds": 12.25,
      "text": "I'll explain what these mean in a moment let me tell you where I've got to i'd lean towards an unexplained weight loss that needs a proper work-up"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 225.26,
      "end_seconds": 227.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "Is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.54,
      "end_seconds": 263.22,
      "duration_seconds": 33.68,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like an unexplained weight loss that needs a proper work-up, but I'd like to confirm. I'm going to order blood tests, for weight loss. A chest X-ray is what I'd like next, for cough and weight loss. Weigh yourself once a week at the same time and note it down. I'd like you to see the chest clinic as well, and I'll write the referral."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 263.92,
      "end_seconds": 264.62,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "okay"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.1,
      "end_seconds": 277.39,
      "duration_seconds": 11.29,
      "text": "A thyroid test is something we might do if this doesn't improve next month. Please don't wait if the symptoms get worse. That's when to be seen urgently"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 283.17,
      "end_seconds": 285.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "Thank you, that's clear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.22,
      "end_seconds": 292.8,
      "duration_seconds": 5.58,
      "text": "Book a review in two weeks. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 294.08,
      "end_seconds": 297.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "Thank you, you know, doctor, goodbye."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.54,
      "end_seconds": 300.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "Have a good day."
    }
